        <body>
            <div xml:id="d267-a1">

                <pb facs="0477" n="417" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg417"/>

                <head>No. 1.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">Department of Treasury and Public Credit.–Section 2.</p>
                <p>It has reached the knowledge of the President of the republic that there exists
                    in your possession $38,000 proceeding from the Spanish convention, and which you
                    propose to distribute. By his order you are prohibited from carrying into effect
                    such distribution, <pb facs="0478" n="418" xml:id="pg418"/> and you are directed
                    to hold the said sum at the disposition of the supreme government until it shall
                    think proper to otherwise order.</p>
                <p>Independence, liberty, and reform! Mexico, October 22, 1867.</p>
                <p>For the minister,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>J. TORREA, <hi rendition="#italic">Chief Clerk.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Miguel Buch,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Present.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
